Name        Cybersecurity
Author      Decksy
Description "Adds cybersecurity software (endpoint protection, firewalls and firewall OS, SIEM, certificate authorities, threat intelligence, identity, network security, testing and forensics, data protection) and hardware (firewalls, security keys, HSMs), plus cyber incidents that hit successful companies. Assign Service staff (Support-trained ones are fastest) to contain them in time, or customers sue."
